# Track only the AX7020 delivery and its interface specifications.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/BASELINE.md
!/john-ax7020-*/
!/AX7020_*.md
!/寄存器划分.xlsx
!/outputs/
/outputs/*
!/outputs/axi-registers-20261028/
/outputs/axi-registers-20261028/*
!/outputs/axi-registers-20261028/*.xlsx
!/outputs/axi-registers-20261028/build_registers.mjs
**/build/
**/logs/
**/.Xil/
**/NA/
**/__pycache__/
**/node_modules/
**/*.jou
**/*.log
**/*.wdb
**/*.vcd
**/*.exe
**/xsim.dir/
**/*.pb
**/~$*
# Upstream runtime dictionaries and unrelated board bitstreams are not build inputs.
**/third_party/john/run/*.chr
**/third_party/john/run/password.lst
**/third_party/john/run/ztex/*.bit
# Only upstream FPGA/protocol sources are needed for this hardware baseline.
/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/*
!/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/LICENSE
!/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/README.md
!/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/src/
/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/src/*
!/john-ax7020-bcrypt8/third_party/john/src/ztex/
